        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-800, Twisted Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSophisticated and beautiful, RK International's Twist Cabinet Pull is perfect for traditional homes as a stately finishing touch. The twisted design really elevates this cabinet pull into opulence. It is available in 3 sizes: 3 inch, 5 inch, and 8 inch. Choose from any of the 7 available finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/twisted-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-702\"><b>Twist Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-twisted-door-handle-rk-international-ph-4803\"><b>12 Inch Twist Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-800 Beautiful Twisted Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-800</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-801</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-802</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
